  "summary_en": "Singapore IMDA/PDPC invitation to industry to pilot a voluntary AI Governance Testing Framework and Toolkit (MVP). It combines technical tests and process checks against 8 AI ethics principles (e.g., fairness, explainability, robustness), aims at interoperability with other frameworks and contributions to international standards. No robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
